# Terminal Configuration

This configuration file controls the behavior and appearance of the 00OS terminal interface.

## Settings

- `prefix`: The command prefix character(s) to identify terminal commands (default: `>`)
- `theme`: Visual styling for the terminal output
- `history`: Maximum number of commands to store in history
- `autoComplete`: Enable/disable command auto-completion 